[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! Shared infrastructure of the benchmark suite.",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//!",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! Every operation is measured on the same six subjects, so the modules below",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! only describe *what* is prepared and *what* is measured, and the",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! [`benchmark_operation`] macro takes care of running it everywhere:",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//!",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | Subject                       | Database | Memory        |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! |-------------------------------|----------|---------------|",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | `SQLite_Memory`               | SQLite   | volatile      |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | `SQLite_File`                 | SQLite   | non-volatile  |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | `Doublets_United_Volatile`    | Doublets | volatile      |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | `Doublets_United_NonVolatile` | Doublets | non-volatile  |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | `Doublets_Split_Volatile`     | Doublets | volatile      |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! | `Doublets_Split_NonVolatile`  | Doublets | non-volatile  |",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//!",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! The data of an iteration is prepared *outside* of the measured region with",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! [`Criterion::iter_custom`](criterion::Bencher::iter_custom), so that the",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! reported time is the time of the operation itself and not the time of",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-//! filling the storage.",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-use criterion::{Bencher, Criterion};",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-use sqlite_vs_doublets::{Benched, Links, Objects};",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-use std::{",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-    env,",
[2026-10-04T16:46:33.776Z] [INFO]                 "-    ops::DerefMut,",
