nchmarks/bench_csharp.png)\n58\t\n59\t![C# benchmark comparison, logarithmic scale](docs/benchmarks/bench_csharp_log_scale.png)\n60\t<!--CSHARP_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_END-->\n61\t\n62\t### Rust link and object results\n63\t\n64\t<!--RUST_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_START-->\n65\t_Generated 2026-09-19 18:46 UTC for Rust by [GitHub Actions run 35459522519](https://github.com/linksplatform/Comparisons.SQLiteVSDoublets/actions/runs/35459522519) — 1000 benchmarked links, 3000 background links, 1000 objects._\n66\t\n67\t| Operation           | Doublets United Volatile | Doublets United NonVolatile | Doublets Split Volatile | Doublets Split NonVolatile | SQLite Memory | SQLite File |\n68\t|---------------------|--------------------------|-----------------------------|-------------------------|----------------------------|---------------|-------------|\n69\t| Create              | 141747 (40.7x faster)    | 143659 (40.2x faster)       | 69524 (83.0x faster)    | 69702 (82.8x faster)       | 5772002       | 993908545   |\n70\t| Update              | 283809 (29.6x faster)    | 277912 (30.2x faster)       | 63882 (131.3x faster)   | 72899 (115.1x faster)      | 8390541       | 1067410860  |\n71\t| Delete              | 168149 (26.8x faster)    | 166496 (27.1x faster)       | 77711 (58.0x faster)    | 78217 (57.6x faster)       | 4509130       | 977528491   |\n72\t| Each All            | 31671 (15.9x faster)     | 31638 (15.9x faster)        | 34426 (14.6x faster)    | 34487 (14.6x faster)       | 504031        | 595624      |\n73\t| Each Identity       | 2132 (1269.3x faster)    | 2136 (1266.9x faster)       | 2130 (1270.5x faster)   | 2127 (1272.3x faster)      | 2706180       | 10678850    |\n74\t| Each Concrete       | 124784 (34.7x faster)    | 120544 (36.0x faster)       | 45647 (95.0x faster)    | 43793 (99.0x faster)       | 4335748       | 12668554    |\n75\t| Each Outgoing       | 210057 (18.1x faster)    | 208064 (18.2x faster)       | 44112 (86.0x faster)    | 45302 (83.7x faster)