[2026-10-04T18:21:46.722Z] [INFO]         "content": "README.md:3:# Comparisons.SQLiteVSDoublets ([русская версия](README.ru.md))\nREADME.md:11:## Automated benchmark suite\nREADME.md:43:<!--CSHARP_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_START-->\nREADME.md:60:<!--CSHARP_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_END-->\nREADME.md:64:<!--RUST_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_START-->\nREADME.md:84:<!--RUST_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_END-->\nREADME.md:86:The original C# object comparison and its historical results remain below.\nREADME.md:88:## SQLite\nREADME.md:132:## Doublets\nREADME.md:190:## [Result](https://www.icloud.com/keynote/0cYVNWkWD5RLU0k-XIBs3qWkA#Sqlite_vs_Doublets)\nREADME.md:223:## Conclusion\nREADME.ru.md:3:# Comparisons.SQLiteVSDoublets ([english version](README.md))\nREADME.ru.md:11:## Автоматизированный набор тестов производительности\nREADME.ru.md:43:<!--CSHARP_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_START-->\nREADME.ru.md:60:<!--CSHARP_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_END-->\nREADME.ru.md:64:<!--RUST_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_START-->\nREADME.ru.md:84:<!--RUST_BENCHMARK_RESULTS_END-->\nREADME.ru.md:86:Исходное сравнение объектов на C# и его исторические результаты сохранены ниже.\nREADME.ru.md:88:## SQLite\nREADME.ru.md:132:## Дуплеты\nREADME.ru.md:190:## [Результат](https://www.icloud.com/keynote/0cYVNWkWD5RLU0k-XIBs3qWkA#Sqlite_vs_Doublets)\nREADME.ru.md:224:## Заключение\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Times one repetition of every variant to plan sizes and CI job splits.\n# Usage: experiments/sizing/run.sh <links|objects> <32|64> <size> [extra args]\nset -euo pipefail\ncategory=$1 bits=$2 size=$3\nshift 3\nbinary=\"$(dirname \"$0\")/../../rust/target/release/sqlite-vs-doublets\"\nlog=\"/tmp/sizing-$category-$bits-$size.log\"\nstart=$(date +%s)\n\"$binary\" \"$category\" \"$bits\" \"$size\" --repetitions 1 --directory \"/tmp/sizing-$category-$bits-$size\" \\\n  --output \"/tmp/sizing-$category-$bits-$size.json\" \"$@\" > \"$log\" 2>&1\necho \"$category $bits $size: $(( $(date +%s) - start )) s\"\ngrep '#1' \"$log\"\nrun.sh",
